# Generated files and local settings stay ignored inside allowed dirs
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
/docs/.vitepress/cache/
/docs/.vitepress/dist/
**/TestResults/
**/.DS_Store
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/.env
**/.env.*
/mise.local.toml

!/LICENSE
!/.env.copyme
